//RS /// Open the cached-runtime block. Everything from here to `CACHED_RUNTIME_END`
//RS /// is decided by build facts alone — never by user source text — so the native
//RS /// builder compiles it once into a content-addressed rlib and links it
//RS /// (`jet_store::runtime`).
